{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_06_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_06",
  "title": "杀手女皇",
  "storyCode": "OF-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "65fdf6e42e4c95fc58ac986903c44461292b89a935bb9a75bc61120f282e6b37",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "全、全都打倒了？我从来......都不知道你有这么厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "我也想象过，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "所以我不想让小姐知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "但你实在是太厉害了！好帅呀，黑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "你是怎么跳那么高的！顺着墙窜上去，然后直接翻身跃下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "就在空中这么旋转，所有射击都被你躲过去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "然后扭过身体，啪啪啪，连着把他们全都射倒！天哪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "小姐......你这么说，我的脸会很烫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "不过，黑，我要纠正一点。刚才我可没有在命令你，我只是作为朋友在请求你而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "你如果有什么想做的事情，也可以和我说呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "嗯？我们刚才怎么说来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "别这么说话！朋友，是朋友！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "我......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "呵呵。我们快去市政厅吧，不知道博士他们那里现在是什么情况......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些饭桶，连一个小姑娘都拦不住吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁的保镖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可她是萨卡兹！而且对方还有其他好几个人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不也就只有几个人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可、可恶的罗德岛，怎么会在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
      "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
      "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
      "text": "什么嘛，感觉这些家伙，怎么比源石虫还弱的样子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赶快把所有的人手都调过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁的保镖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是克洛宁先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁的保镖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我觉得，打不过，就是打不过！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没什么可是！别往后退啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
      "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
      "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
      "text": "呵欠......唉，博士，你找到没有啊？我还要去听LIVE呢，要是赶不上我可就亏大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我得到了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "嗯，已经找到账簿和债券了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
          "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
          "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "哦？找到了啊？果然打他们一顿是有用的嘛。陨星姐也说了，暴力有时候是必要的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "该，该死！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不管了，只要现在能逃走，手续什么的好补得很！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
          "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
          "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "啊，博士，他从窗户逃走了！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这些资料，我们把它都带上！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
          "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
          "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "好~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
          "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
          "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "咦，将军他还在外面吧？感觉这个克洛宁什么的的下场会很惨啊，还不如没逃走呢......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
          "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
          "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "来，博士，我帮你拿！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哈，哈哈......该死。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "必须，必须马上把其他人叫回来！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "上一次，罗德岛的博士和贵市的锡兰小姐从那个窗户跳了出来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "时来运转，现在是汐斯塔的天灾信使克洛宁先生跳出了窗户。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "人生也许很无常，先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你......你！我的手下呢？我的手下呢？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "放在这里会影响游客参观。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "顺便，这两位小姐已经在这里等你很久了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "黑......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们两个站在一起，也就是说......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也就是说你要完蛋了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "证据现在都在我们手中，你难逃法网了，先生。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "博士，请小心，他也许还会做些垂死挣扎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们......你们......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "你的计划败露了，克洛宁！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
